eriod is closed or reopened. This component issue is not a revenue line, COGS recognition, or manual cost adjustment exception.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"policy\\\": {\\n    \\\"source_resource_id\\\": \\\"r_8583a38bb1302773d157eea1\\\",\\n    \\\"source_file\\\": \\\"workspace/02_Cost_Accounting/oracle_supply_chain_cost_management_26b.pdf\\\",\\n    \\\"pdf_page\\\": 233,\\n    \\\"printed_page\\\": 225,\\n    \\\"section\\\": \\\"Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting\\\",\\n    \\\"relevant_text\\\": \\\"When a period is in the Pending Close status, any new transaction that falls in or before the period won't be staged in Cost Accounting or Receipt Accounting. After the period is closed or reopened, these new transactions will be processed. Transactions created after the pending close date, even if they relate to a current or prior period, won't be processed. Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments will continue to be processed even after the period is set to Pending Close.\\\",\\n    \\\"application\\\": \\\"The event is an INPUT component issue with event_date 2025-09-30 and cost_period_id PER-COST-2025-09, created after that period's Pending Close timestamp. None of the listed exceptions applies.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"calculation\\\": {\\n    \\\"formula\\\": \\\"(event_created_time - pending_close_time) / 60 seconds per minute\\\",\\n    \\\"start\\\": \\\"2025-09-30T18:00:00\\\",\\n    \\\"end\\\": \\\"2025-09-30T19:22:00\\\",\\n    \\\"seconds\\\": 4920,\\n    \\\"minutes\\\": 82,\\n    \\\"amount_conversion\\\": \\\"21469834 USD cents / 100 = USD 214698.34\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"source_ids\\\": [\\n    \\\"r_8583a38bb1302773d157eea1\\\",\\n    \\\"r_5cc87a4c0a85190a7d5f04a4\\\",\\n    \\\"r_117d0c5b616b0e20047b9dc1\\\",\\n    \\\"r_e0e9157d667ddbb11df9073d\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"provenance\\\": {\\n    \\\"system\\\": \\\"Oracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B\\\",\\n    \\\"business_source_file\\\": \\\"system/oracle_scm_cost_m